'' A SCAN OF A FILE INCLUDING A HEADER lists the header's macros and the user's -- scanheader.bi,
'' fb/fserror.bi's shape (fb/ left the toolchain 2026-10-10): its 'type FsError' held 'declare const function Code( )', which
'' the preprocessor counted as an opened FUNCTION: FBFS_EXTERN, before it, was listed;
'' FBFSPATH_EXTERN and every macro after, the user's own included, were not.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-scan -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc tests/api/src/scanheader.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: define HDR_BEFORE
'' EXPECT-OUT: define HDR_AFTER
'' EXPECT-OUT: define USER_AFTER  @0:3:9  parent=-1
